@Elotar: What about a good player with a bad deck?

@ReverendRevolver: I just really liked the idea of hitting for tons of agg damage.  I'm kind of sad and puzzled that the Gangrel don't have Potence innately, but I'm of the opinion that VTM should've given each clan 4-5 core disciplines and not just 3. Or that the Protean cards that grant Potence-like effects be much better.  And that +bleed would be more common across more disciplines.

@ Blooded Sand: I will work on it.

Gangrel. Noddist. Camarilla. Once each turn, LivesByProxy may burn 1 blood to lose Protean  until the end of the turn and gain your choice of superior Auspex , Obfuscate , or Potence  for the current action.
